      "effect": "Choose 1 face-up Beast Type Normal Monster on your field. This turn, that monster can make up to 3 attacks on monsters. If you have \"Princess of the Flock - Miss Mutton\" face-up on your field, you can also make all face-up Effect Monsters on your opponent's field lose 500 ATK until the end of this turn."
